{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"平\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的加亮词组更具体、口语，串起来能看见从离开、怀念、动摇到作出选择的变化；Y 的大块常被“旧标准、归属、自持”等抽象说法遮住当下处境。small：Y 的感受和旁注多数能补充身体体验或音乐线索，作为辅助信息也比较合适；X 有些感受会重复话里的意思，或转而描述音乐本身。core：X 更直接呈现不愿再忍受委屈的行动与对旧日亲近的怀念之间的反复拉扯；concise：X 虽然有回环，但大多带出了新的疑问或决定，Y 对“标准、归属、自尊、稳定”的解释反复较多；human：X 的日常说法更自然，Y 的“维持自持”“找不到判断依据”“清楚而有分量的把握”等明显偏书面摘要腔。fine：平，X 的意象更有辨识度，但不少内容在描述音乐本身；Y 更常写身体和心理反应，却也有笼统、重复之处。load：X 的大字块虽然数量稍多，但单块短、总量较少；Y 块数少，却普遍较长，尤其在短停留屏上更费力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "be7e7783-e3df-4b80-a614-74bc913e17b1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T072403808026Z", "elapsed_seconds": 190.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T07:27:14.559121+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2673f49cd0a736eb2e9f76924d617ec7e368383ef9023f1fac9a1471067f5ce1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6